{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、おだななのお誕生日です。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN4G8PG96RGTZR9PDHDRER7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nおめでとう～。\n一つ年下の19才です!\nでも、おだななは年下だって感じないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の中でおだななは、部活の面白い先輩って感じです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綺麗なだにー。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN4GA5EA2M4NFNDM73PJHVA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nほんとに綺麗な顔だ～。\n憧れる顔!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三ヶ日みかんずのかた、今日はお祝いですね!＼(^o^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ハマっているお菓子。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN4GBP4Y8SBC005MRHJ6KEN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nとてもカリウムの量が多くて、すーーーごくおいしいです。\n私の好みの味!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、食べてみて私の好みの味を知ってください～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃおすすめ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}